deepin-widget-toolbar (0.2.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * feat(widget): add app launcher widget with five sizes, a three-level app
    picker, launcherList settings and the DesktopApps proxy
  * feat(widget): add todo mode with XML persistence to the sticky note,
    enabled by default
  * feat(widget): show each card's name below it and add a 4x1 long strip
    size to the world time widget
  * feat(panel): hide the sidebar while it overlaps external panels or the
    multitask view
  * feat(debug): add opt-in rotating debug logs for the panel
  * fix(panel): settle avoidance release by liveness so a stale state can no
    longer hide the panel for good
  * fix(panel): keep dock margins and the grid scroll range in sync with live
    layout changes, and let card contents follow host resize easing
  * fix(panel): snap the drag preview and let the ghost track the drop cell
  * fix(panel): steer X input focus to the panel on note click, center the
    pin icons and anchor the add-widget popup to its trigger
  * fix(widget): localize the world time title, rework its digital layout and
    drop the completed-row wash band in transparent mode
  * fix(settings): hide transparent-inert color rows and the redundant
    per-card switch
  * fix(panel): correct the grid scroll compensation so deleting the topmost
    card no longer shifts the remaining cards by twice the row delta
  * fix(todo): re-measure line geometry when the card is resized or todo mode
    is toggled, so the dots and the strikethrough stay aligned
  * fix(panel): keep the panel's own window out of the avoidance target set,
    stop the focus retry from stealing focus back, discard a late multitask
    answer and record the debug switch being turned off
  * fix(widgets): seed the launcher list within the card capacity, gate the
    widget's diagnostics behind debug mode and declare apiVersion 1.7
  * fix(apps): watch newly created entry directories so the app picker
    refreshes after a store install, and reject or warn on apiVersion
    mismatches instead of checking only the major prefix
  * fix(scripts): detect config items the dde-dconfig daemon has not parsed
    yet, create the log directory only when logging is enabled, and cap the
    number of log files kept
  * build(deb): keep the packaging output free of harmless CMake/Qt notices,
    write the full build log to dist/build.log, and cross-check the app, about
    and package versions before building
  * chore: clear DConfig overrides on uninstall and refresh the daemon view
    on install
  * chore(translations): refresh catalogues for the new widgets and the
    debug-mode label
  * docs: cover the app launcher widget and bump the widget API spec to v1.7
  * chore: drop the in-repo test hook and ignore the local-only test harness

